// The sprites of the Dragon skin, cut out of Tiny RPG Dragon Regalia GUI by tiopalada
// (opengameart.org/content/tiny-rpg-dragon-regalia-gui, CC0) by Art/make_ui_packs.py, which is where to change
// anything in here, this file is written by it. The pack is a folder of PNGs, a strip per button with it at rest,
// under the pointer, held down and switched off side by side. They are all on the one sheet here, art.aseprite,
// with a theme on every layer. Azure is the pack as it comes, a bright blue inside of its gold frames. Night is
// the same with the blue taken down to the indigo of a sky after dark, which is what goes with a fight under
// lanterns, and is the one made for Fighter2D's Japan map.
//
// The names are the ones the components and the layouts ask for, which are Dead Revolver's, so a layout written
// for that skin comes up in this one. The pack has no box to tick and no knob for a slider, those are its round
// close button and its little square one with what is written on them taken off.

